      "initialText": "FIELD KILN\n\nA small fictional pottery shop · Gốm thủ công\n\nYour selection ↗\nObjects\n/\nEveryday Teapot\n01 / FORM STUDY\n650 ML · STONEWARE\n\nOriginal vector illustration of a fictional sample product; not a photograph.\n\nFIELD KILN — EVERYDAY OBJECTS\n\nEveryday\nTeapot\n\nA familiar shape for the everyday pour.\n\n$68.00\nUSD · one piece\n\n4 available in Iron\n\nFictional shop and illustrative product, price, stock, delivery, and returns.\n\nChoose a glaze Iron\nIron\nAsh\nUnavailable\nSand\nQuantity\n1\n2\n3\n4\nUp to 4 per order\nOrder total\nIncludes $8.00 illustrative shipping\n$76.00\nAdd to your selection\n↗\n\nSimulated cart · no purchase or payment is made.\n\n✳\n\nDispatch in 2 business days\nIllustrative domestic transit: 3–5 business days.\n\nTHE USEFUL DETAILS\n\nMade to be\nreached for.\n\nClear facts for choosing a piece that fits your table and routine.\n\nMaterial\nGlazed stoneware\nCapacity\n650 ml\nDimensions\n16 cm wide × 12 cm high\nCare\nHand wash. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Not for stovetop use.\nDelivery\n\nDispatch in 2 business days; illustrative domestic transit 3–5 business days.\n\nReturns\n\nUnused pieces accepted within 30 days. Customer pays return shipping; original shipping is nonrefundable.\n\nFIELD KILN\n\nSample product page · all shop information is fictional.\n\nChoose a glaze ↑",
